@startuml ECU Architecture – AUTOSAR IDS SWC
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle frame

title ECU Deployment – AUTOSAR Classic Architecture\n(Infineon AURIX TC3xx / NXP S32G)

package "AUTOSAR BSW (Basic Software)" as BSW {
    component "MCAL\n(CAN Driver)" as MCAL #LightBlue
    component "CAN Interface\n(CanIf)" as CanIf #LightBlue
    component "PDU Router\n(PduR)" as PduR #LightBlue
    component "COM Stack" as COM #LightBlue
    component "DCM\n(Diagnostic\nCommunication)" as DCM #LightBlue
    component "DEM\n(Diagnostic\nEvent Manager)" as DEM #LightBlue
    component "NvM\n(Non-Volatile\nMemory)" as NvM #LightBlue
    component "RTE\n(Runtime Environment)" as RTE #LightGoldenRodYellow
}

package "AUTOSAR SWC Layer" as SWC_Layer {
    package "IDS SWC (tiny-can-ids)" as IDS_SWC #LightGreen {
        component "CAN Frame\nBuffer\n(Rte_Read)" as FrameBuf
        component "Feature\nExtraction\n(46 features)" as FeatExt
        component "Model Inference\n(static C code)" as Inference #PaleGreen
        component "Alert\nManager" as AlertMgr
    }

    package "Model Weights (Flash)" as Weights #Wheat {
        component "tiny_ids_tnn_weights.h\n(INT8 arrays)" as TNN_W
        component "tiny_ids_lr_weights.h\n(INT8 coef)" as LR_W
        component "tiny_ids_dt_weights.h\n(tree nodes)" as DT_W
    }

    component "Application SWC\n(Vehicle Functions)" as AppSWC #LightCyan
}

package "AUTOSAR Services" as Services {
    component "UCM\n(Update &\nConfig Mgr)" as UCM #Plum
    component "SecOC\n(Secure\nOnboard Comm)" as SecOC #Plum
}

' === Data flows ===
MCAL --> CanIf : Raw CAN\nframes
CanIf --> PduR : CAN PDUs
PduR --> COM : Signal routing
COM --> RTE : Signal\ndelivery

RTE --> FrameBuf : Rte_Read_CAN_Frame
FrameBuf --> FeatExt : Sliding window\n(100 frames)
FeatExt --> Inference : float[46]\nfeature vector

TNN_W --> Inference
LR_W --> Inference
DT_W --> Inference

Inference --> AlertMgr : Prediction\n(0=normal, 1=attack)
AlertMgr --> RTE : Rte_Write_IDS_Alert
RTE --> DEM : DTC report\n(0xC10100)
RTE --> DCM : UDS response\n(DID 0xF1F0)
AlertMgr --> NvM : Log event\n(persistent)

UCM --> IDS_SWC : OTA model\nupdate (UDS)
SecOC --> CanIf : Frame\nauthentication

note right of Inference
  **Inference functions (all static C, no malloc):**
  • tiny_ids_tnn_predict(float*, int) → int
  • tiny_ids_lr_predict(float*, int) → int
  • tiny_ids_dt_predict(float*, int) → int
  Runs in ~100 µs – 2 ms on Cortex-M/R
end note

note bottom of FeatExt
  **46 features per window:**
  22 ID frequency + 4 timing
  + 17 payload + 3 rate/novelty
end note

@enduml